@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Usuario
participant "UI / Cliente" as UI
participant "API Principal\napps/api/main.py" as API
participant "API Fase 2.1\nfase2_1/api/main.py" as API21
participant "Pipeline TryOn\ncore/tryon/pipeline.py" as P
participant "Pose\ncore/tryon/pose.py" as Pose
participant "Parsing\ncore/tryon/parsing.py" as Parsing
participant "Align\ncore/tryon/align.py" as Align
participant "Contract\ncore/tryon/contract.py" as Contract
participant "Batch\ncore/tryon/batch.py" as Batch
participant "Review\ncore/tryon/review.py" as Review
database "Artifacts\nreport.json / manual_reviews.jsonl / consolidated.json" as FS
participant "Scripts\nevaluate_batch.py\nbenchmark_latency.py\nprepare_validation_dataset.py" as Scripts

== Ejecucion single try-on ==
Usuario -> UI: Solicita prueba de prenda
UI -> API: POST /fase2_1/tryon/run
API -> P: run_tryon(request)
P -> Pose: detect_pose(image)
Pose --> P: landmarks
P -> Parsing: segment_person(image, output_mask_path)
alt backend disponible
  Parsing --> P: backend=mediapipe_selfie_segmentation
else falla backend
  Parsing --> P: backend=fallback_ellipse
end
P -> Align: compute_scale(landmarks, garment_type)
Align --> P: scale
P -> Contract: build_landmarks_contract()
P -> Contract: build_transform_contract()
Contract --> P: contratos v1.0
P --> API: TryOnResult + meta (scale, segmentation, contracts)
API --> UI: JSON respuesta

== Evaluacion batch ==
UI -> API: POST /fase2_1/tryon/batch
API -> Batch: run_tryon_batch(...)
loop por cada imagen
  Batch -> P: run_tryon()
  P --> Batch: resultado por imagen
end
Batch -> FS: escribe report.json (summary/results)
Batch --> API: resumen batch
API --> UI: estado + metricas auto

== Evaluacion manual y consolidado ==
Usuario -> UI: Revisa outputs
UI -> API: POST /fase2_1/tryon/evaluate
API -> Review: append_manual_review(criteria_scores)
Review -> FS: append manual_reviews.jsonl
Review --> API: score manual
API --> UI: evaluacion guardada

UI -> API: GET /fase2_1/tryon/evaluate-summary?valid_score_threshold=...
API -> Review: summarize_manual_reviews(...)
Review --> API: avg_score + visually_valid_rate
API --> UI: resumen manual

UI -> API: GET /fase2_1/tryon/evaluate-consolidated
API -> Review: build_consolidated_evaluation_report(...)
Review -> FS: consolidated_report.json (opcional)
Review --> API: manual_acceptance_passed (target >= 90%)
API --> UI: resumen combinado

== Scripts operativos ==
Usuario -> Scripts: prepare_validation_dataset.py
Scripts -> FS: validation_manifest.json (20-50 objetivo)

Usuario -> Scripts: benchmark_latency.py
Scripts -> Batch: run_tryon_batch(limit=N)
Batch --> Scripts: latencias por imagen
Scripts --> FS: benchmark summary (p50/p95/p99)

Usuario -> Scripts: evaluate_batch.py
Scripts -> Batch: run_tryon_batch(...)
Scripts -> Review: summarize + consolidated
Scripts -> FS: consolidated_report.json

== API Fase 2.1 directa ==
UI -> API21: /tryon/run | /tryon/batch | /tryon/evaluate*
API21 -> P: mismo core pipeline/review
API21 --> UI: contratos equivalentes

@enduml
